    "title": "商品信息批量修改",
    "keywords": "",
    "description": "",
    "content": "<h2 id=\"%E6%89%B9%E9%87%8F%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9%E5%95%86%E5%93%81%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF\" tabindex=\"-1\">批量修改商品基础信息<a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#%E6%89%B9%E9%87%8F%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9%E5%95%86%E5%93%81%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></a></h2>\n<p><video src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202503/d0f067b26dca84c982ca6d800facf56c.mp4\" controls=\"controls\" class=\"my-video\" style=\"max-width:100%\">\n\n\n视频描述\n</video></p>\n<p><strong>操作步骤1：【商品】-【商品列表】- 勾选要修改的商品 -【批量操作】-【修改商品信息】</strong>\n<img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202410/82cdfa49c9f406ec47afb3f3290dae16.png\" alt=\"Description\">\n<strong>操作步骤2：点击下载表格 - 选择需要修改的商品和修改信息 -【下载表格】</strong>\n<img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202410/c68fab0353085b68af3ac48b17824b50.png\" alt=\"Description\">\n<img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202410/4fc06ea73bb41ba90fe8c19eb0aadb29.png\" alt=\"Description\">\n<strong>操作步骤3：打开下载好的表格输入修改后的信息保存关闭表格文件，选择上传文件-立即导入</strong>\n<img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202410/3063270b1b1ca29e7fc43a7bdc50f003.png\" alt=\"Description\">\n<img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202410/8cc20907053152b990a1b6820a471ff7.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n",
